    "updated_at": "2026-10-10T17:00:59Z",
    "body": "Tested this PR as submitted (0d4444afc, build 11550, Metal) on our setup: M2 Ultra, Qwen3.8-27B-UD-Q4_K_M plus mmproj, `--parallel 10 --kv-unified --no-cache-idle-slots --cache-ram 8192`. Both test clients were pinned to one slot (`id_slot` 7, the trigger), with live traffic from other clients alongside. Each request carries a unique reference, so any response containing another request's reference or output counts as a crossing.\n\n| | pinned pairs sent together | crossings | corrupted responses |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| build 11146, no fix | 30 | 1 | 9 |\n| **this PR** | **60** | **0** | **0** |\n\nOne round timed out on our side (a 60 s client timeout) while the two pinned requests waited for the slot. The server started cleanly with our existing flags. Thanks for the quick fix!",
